@startuml overview
' cumin-works - when cumin notifies. Each cause is notified once.
' Render: run scripts/render-diagrams.sh at the root of the repository.

left to right direction

rectangle "an issue enters a state of a person's turn\n(awaiting-plan-review, awaiting-merge-decision,\nawaiting-acceptance, awaiting-decision)" as Turn
rectangle "cumin cannot take an issue\n(a label it does not take, no single Assignee,\nan issue it cannot read whole)" as Cannot
rectangle "cumin stops agent starts\n(a usage limit, an unread usage,\na failed tool check, failed polls)" as Stop
rectangle "nothing goes on without a Maintainer" as Waits

rectangle "notify once:\na link and one line of the reason" as Notify
rectangle "the issue and the pull request\nhold the details and the talk" as GitHub

Turn --> Notify
Cannot --> Notify
Stop --> Notify
Waits --> Notify
Notify --> GitHub : the reader goes to

@enduml
